  "id": "fluctuation-of-perception",
  "term": "fluctuation of perception",
  "definition": "Fluctuation of perception is the spontaneous, irregular shifting of what a person perceives between different possible interpretations of the same ambiguous stimulus. It is described as a feature of perceptual bistability, where perception alternates over time rather than staying fixed.",
